Kobento component definitions and theme

definitions.json and theme.json in this directory are derived from Kobento
(https://mcp.kobento.dev/, https://github.com/kobento), an independent
implementation of RemoteCompose, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(LICENSE in this directory).

They were taken from Kobento's MCP server by generator/snapshot.py fetch:
definitions.json from `get {name, definition: true}` for each library component,
keeping each definition's structure (params, slots, locals, body) and dropping its
summary, documentation, pitfalls and example call; theme.json from Kobento's own
expansion of a probe document, which reads back every theme number and colour the
definitions use, in each look.

json2rc.mjs is Kobento's JSON to .rc converter (kobento-tools' json2rc), bundled
into one browser module by generator/build-json2rc.sh from the kobento-tools
commit named in its first line, so an editor can compile an expanded design.

